  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Norrsken Rwanda - Women In Business Initiative</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Norrsken Rwanda - Women In Business Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden har godk&#xe4;nt ett anslag till Norrsken Rwanda Ltd f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra en pilotinsats f&#xf6;r kvinnligt f&#xf6;retagande. Pilotinsatsen syftar till att utforska effektiva metoder f&#xf6;r att uppmuntra och st&#xf6;dja kvinnliga entrepren&#xf6;rer. Detta &#xe4;r t&#xe4;nkt att uppn&#xe5;s genom att g&#xf6;ra det m&#xf6;jligt f&#xf6;r framg&#xe5;ngsrika kvinnliga entrepren&#xf6;rer att vara f&#xf6;rebilder f&#xf6;r unga talanger b&#xe5;de inom Rwanda och i regionen.
 
Specifikt f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntas detta pilot partnerskap i) testa och utforma ett effektivt tillv&#xe4;gag&#xe5;ngss&#xe4;tt f&#xf6;r att skapa ett ekosystem som skulle st&#xf6;dja kvinnliga entrepren&#xf6;rer, ii) n&#xe5; en h&#xf6;g f&#xf6;rst&#xe5;else f&#xf6;r specifika begr&#xe4;nsningar som kvinnliga entrepren&#xf6;rer m&#xf6;ter, och vilken typ av st&#xf6;dtj&#xe4;nster de beh&#xf6;ver f&#xf6;r att v&#xe4;xa och accelerera sin verksamhet, iii) Pilottj&#xe4;nster, evenemang, aktiviteter och program f&#xf6;r kvinnliga entrepren&#xf6;rer och nystartade f&#xf6;retag av kvinnor och slutligen iv) identifiera och/eller hj&#xe4;lpa till att skapa kvinnliga f&#xf6;rebilder i entrepren&#xf6;rskaps- och innovationsekosystem.
 
Insatsen kommer ocks&#xe5; att vara n&#xe4;ra kopplad till befintliga engagemang och insatser som st&#xf6;ds av RW-SE-strategin d&#xe4;r det &#xe4;r m&#xf6;jligt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The embassy has a approved a grant to Norrsken Rwanda Ltd to implement a pilot intervention on women entrepreneurship. The pilot intervention aims to explore effective methods for encouraging and supporting
women entrepreneurs. This is intended to be achieved through enabling and grooming
successful women entrepreneurs into role models for aspiring young talents both in
Rwanda and the region. Specifically, this pilot partnership is expected to i) test and
design an effective approach to creating an ecosystem that would support women
entrepreneurs, ii) reach a high understanding of specific constraints that women
entrepreneurs face, and the type of support services that they need to grow and
accelerate their business, iii) Pilot service offerings, events, activities, and programs for
women entrepreneurs and women-led start-ups and lastly iv) identify and/or help create
women role models in the entrepreneurship and innovation ecosystem. The intervention will also closely link with existing engagements  and interventions supported through the RW-SE strategy where possible.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This intervention aims to explore effective methods for encouraging and supporting women entrepreneurs in Rwanda. This is intended to be achieved through enabling and grooming successful women entrepreneurs into role models for aspiring young talents both in Rwanda and the region. Specifically, this pilot partnership with Norrsken is expected to i) test and design an effective approach to creating an ecosystem that would support women entrepreneurs, ii) reach a high understanding of specific constraints that women entrepreneurs face, and the type of support services that they need to grow and accelerate their business, iii) Pilot service offerings, events, activities, and programs for women entrepreneurs and women-led start-ups and lastly iv) identify and/or help create women role models in the entrepreneurship and innovation ecosystem.</narrative>
  </description>
